<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady-up $.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady-up $.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were</p>
<p>steady to $0.50 higher. Demand and supplies were moderate. Top $55.75 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>			   Country			     Plants</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs. 53.00-54.50 Few 52.50 &amp; 55.00</p>
<p>							     54.00-55.75</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs. 46.50-52.50</p>
<p>	  210-230 lbs. 41.50-46.50</p>
<p>Sows:  1.00-2.00 Lower, some over 600 lbs. 3.00 Lower.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 40.00-45.00</p>
<p>	  450-500 lbs. 44.00-46.00</p>
<p>	  500-650 lbs. 47.00-50.00 Few over 650 lbs. 51.00</p>
